KHAAK HOTE HAI ARMAAN LAILA KE MIT TI HAI JAWAANI AKBAR KI, <br>
PHAT TI HAI CHHATI ZAINAB KI BENOOR HAI AANKHEIN SARWAR KI<br>
<br>
AE WAE JAWANMARGI TERI BEKAS KO SISAKTA CHHODH GAYE,<br>
 LOOTI HAI BIZAAT PEERI MEIN KYA KHAAK BASAR HO MADAR KI<br>
<br>
TO RAHAT-E-JAAN TO NOOR-E-NAZAR TU DIL KA SUKOON TASKEEN-E- JIGAR ,<br>
 AB HASHR PA HAI DIDAAR-E-NABI TASWEER MITI PAIYGHAMBAR KI<br>
<br>
AANKHOUN MEIN PHOOPHI NE THA PALA BACHCHON KO KIYA TUJHPAR SADQA,<br>
 YE DAAG TUJH HI SE MILNA THA TAQDEER YE BINTE HYDER KI<br>
<br>
AYA NA TUJHE YE DHIYAN KABHI MARJAYEGA BABA JEETEJI,<br>
 ANKHON SE BASARAT JA HI CHUKI AB KHAIR HO JISME LAGHAR KI<br>
<br>
EK HOOK SE UTHTI HAI MANN JAB CHAND NIKALTA HAI BANN MEIN,<br>
 WO CHAND SA MUKHDA YAAD AATA SHAB ROTE KATI GHAR BHAR KI<br>
<br>
